The primary runner must cover:

- the exact 43-site common block, six branches, 24 proper rotations, and at
  least three nontrivial translations;
- all branch Record masks, physical one-site density matrices, product-state
  normalization, mask orthogonality, and output-site coincidences;
- exact CP/effect/completeness/trace-preservation/covariance identities for the
  declared instrument, plus symbolic identity on every nonblank mask rather
  than sampling `2^43-1` masks;
- all 43 single-site occupied controls and every occupied site in each branch's
  required Record/gap/candidate/live-packet footprint;
- all six generated branches, fourteen next outcomes, and 32 obstacle masks
  in direct controller composition (`2,688` maps), plus all `2,976` frozen
  blocked frontier components inherited from Block 15;
- exact equality of all one-site marginals in the correlated/product model
  pair and the registered rational valid-configuration probability;
- source/AST scans excluding a public or hidden host `f`, branch-specific
  precursor, role, epoch, tape, site ID, scheduler, global clock, and same-event
