## Prospective adjudication

Exactly one terminal must be returned:

- `COVARIANT-CONDITIONAL-CAP-PACKET-INSTRUMENT`: one common blank input and one
  total covariant instrument generate all six complete branch outputs, and
  every branch composes exactly into Block 15;
- `BRANCH-TABLE-ONLY`: the six configurations can be listed but no common-input
  CP/TP covariant instrument or branch-independent code path is established;
- `NONPHYSICAL-PACKET`: a Record/source state is nonpositive, nonnormalized,
  nonequivariant, or not the exact live shell;
- `FOOTPRINT-CONFLICT`: branch sites coincide improperly, an occupied input is
  overwritten, the cap creates a false tip, or Block-15 composition fails;
- `NO-MEMBER`: no member of the fixed trace-and-prepare instrument family meets
  the registered target.

Even the positive terminal retires the supplied `f` and supplied capped state
only **conditional on a selected center and occurrence of this atomic block
event**.  It does not establish a nearest-neighbor microscopic circuit,
blank-sector detector, overlapping-center arbitration, occurrence site,
hazard/rate, time, gravity, or a law uniquely selected by the minimal axioms.

## Hard falsifiers

- any input argument, lookup, or precursor already contains `f`;
- the six branches do not share the same `Pi_blank` input and code path;
- a branch weight differs from `1/6`, a Choi/effect is nonpositive, or the
  branch plus STOP effects do not sum to identity;
- `a(Qf) != Q a(f)`, `sigma_f` is nonphysical, or covariance fails;
- two branch Record masks overlap as sectors, the gap fills, cap/trail/live
  sites are misplaced, or any extra Record appears;
- STOP changes an occupied Record/content or the map leaves a mask uncovered;
- any generated branch fails the complete Block-15 tip/controller/STOP tests;
- the model pair's one-site marginals differ or the product valid probability
  is not the frozen rational value;
- claim a nearest-neighbor implementation, concurrency, occurrence/rate/time,
  gravity, axiom amendment, audit retention, obligation retirement, or TOE
  percentage movement.

